{
  "layout": "scanned",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "また、お掃除の邪魔する～",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなたー",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "は、ここの主人じゃなさそうね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なんなの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様のお客様？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "紅魔館のメイド",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "十六夜 咲夜",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "（倒しに来たってっても通してくれ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ないよな）",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "通さないよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様は滅多に人に会うような",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ことはないわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "軟禁されてるの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様は暗いところが好きなのよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "暗くないあなたでもいいわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ここら辺一帯に霧を出してるの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなた達でしょ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あれが迷惑なの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何が目的なの？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "日光が邪魔だからよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様、冥い好きだし",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私は好きじゃないわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "止めてくれる？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "それはお嬢様に言ってよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "じゃ呼んできて",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "って、ご主人様を危険な目に",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "遭わせる訳無いでしょ？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ここで騒ぎを起こせば出て",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "くるかしら？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "もう十分騒がしいわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "でも、あなたはお嬢様には",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "会えない",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "それこそ、時間を止めてでも",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "時間稼ぎが出来るから",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さぁ、会わせてくれるかしら",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "強い・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "でも、お嬢様ならあるいは",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あー、お掃除が進まない！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様に怒られるじゃない！！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さぁ、どおだ！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "その程度で、なにいきがってんのよ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "まだまだだわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "２時間前に出直してきな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "また、お掃除の邪魔する～",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "いやはやメイドとは",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "捕まえるとワシントン条約に",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "引っかかるな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、魔法使いは生類哀れみの令",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "だあね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "紅魔館のメイド",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "十六夜 咲夜",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "哀れんでぇ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなたもこの館に雇われたの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "かしら？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ああ、そうでもいいな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "でも、あんたじゃ掃除も出来そう",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "に無いわね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "出来ないぜ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "じゃぁ、何係？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "恋愛係？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "むしろ営繕係だな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "何だよそれ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "小学校でもあるまいし",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "恋愛係は中等部なのか？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "さて、早速仕事に取りかかって",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "貰おうかしら",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "言い忘れたけど私は、ここの",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "メイド長の咲夜。",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "ってことは、私があなたを倒せば",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "メイド長ってことね",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そういって返り討ちに会った人は",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "トリウム崩壊系列の数より多いわ",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あ、結構普通なんだな",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そういうことって",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あなたの時間も私のもの・・・",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "古風な魔女に勝ち目は、ない",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "メイドじゃなくても、メイド長に",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なれるのか？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "なれるわけ無いじゃない",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あー、お掃除が進まない！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "お嬢様に怒られるじゃない！！",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "あー、疲れた",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そろそろ帰ったら？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "私も仕事あるし",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そうします",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "そう？",
      "encoding": "shift_jis"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "time": 0,
      "text": "じゃ",
